<title>USA: Liuski International names CFO.</title>
<headline>Liuski International names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liuski International Inc said Wednesday that William Mauldin was named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Mauldin replaces Mark Rafuse, who left the company to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Most recently, Mauldin was vice president of finance and the chief financial officer of Gates/FA Distributing Inc GAFA.O, which is now a unit of Arrow Electronics Inc.</p>
